{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"形模态"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"形模态"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"合聚意象","text":"合聚意象"}},{"Plain":"中, <strong>形模态</strong> (shape modality) $ʃ$ 将一个对象 $X$ 对应到其 “基本 $\\infty$-群胚” 给出的 “生动而不合聚” 的几何对象.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>伴随三元组</h3>\n<p>我们有形模态-"},{"Local":{"url":"平模态","text":"平模态"}},{"Plain":"-"},{"Local":{"url":"尖模态","text":"尖模态"}},{"Plain":"的伴随三元组\n$$\r\nʃ \\dashv \\flat \\dashv \\sharp.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>todo…</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}